<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from August 14 to August 20 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 63.76</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 67.90</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 69.82</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 73.32</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$170.48</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$127.86</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 95.22</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 24.73</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.47</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 27.28</p>
</text>
